From: tacryt-socryp <1377557+tacryt-socryp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 16:52:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/17] nockchain: verify primitive public binding constraints

Recursive batch-STARK verification now reconstructs the primitive Public AIR with proof.public_binding_lanes. The verifier already allocates and packs the external public values; the AIR must include the same first-row binding constraints the prover used or the folded quotient check is evaluated against a different constraint system.

diff --git a/recursion/src/verifier/batch_stark.rs b/recursion/src/verifier/batch_stark.rs
index 0ee416bf3f4aa186a93297001f377cebb818ce05..4f41d4249bbe93285def95360e9afc7afd002964 100644
--- a/recursion/src/verifier/batch_stark.rs
+++ b/recursion/src/verifier/batch_stark.rs
@@ -277,10 +277,10 @@ where
         CircuitTablesAir::Const(ConstAir::<Val<SC>, TRACE_D>::new(
             rows[PrimitiveTable::Const],
         )),
-        CircuitTablesAir::Public(PublicAir::<Val<SC>, TRACE_D>::new(
-            rows[PrimitiveTable::Public],
-            public_lanes,
-        )),
+        CircuitTablesAir::Public(
+            PublicAir::<Val<SC>, TRACE_D>::new(rows[PrimitiveTable::Public], public_lanes)
+                .with_public_binding_lanes(proof.public_binding_lanes),
+        ),
         CircuitTablesAir::Alu(alu_air),
     ];
 
